src/features/<f>/views/   templates for c.view("<f>/<file>", data, .{}); PascalCase
                          files (PostsList.html) are components: <PostsList ... />
src/shared/templates/     layout.html (`extends "layout"`, minimal), app.html
                          (`extends "app"`: navbar, sidebar, mobile nav) + shared
                          components (Toast, NavBar, SideBar, MobileNav)
src/ui.css                the UI kit: every ui-* class (spider ui)
src/styles.css            Tailwind entry: imports ui.css, loads the icon sets
src/embedded_templates.zig  GENERATED on every build from all .html — never edit
public/                   static files, served as-is
